Dialogue: 3,0:22:53.64,0:22:55.65,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}它於何時改變？
Dialogue: 3,0:22:55.65,0:22:57.40,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}曾經它鮮活如綠野
Dialogue: 3,0:22:57.94,0:22:59.77,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}如今它憂鬱似海藍
Dialogue: 3,0:23:03.82,0:23:06.41,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}落葉輕灑於地
Dialogue: 3,0:23:06.99,0:23:10.12,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}為何你觸碰它
Dialogue: 3,0:23:10.12,0:23:13.16,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}你要離我而去？
